  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you are about to delete a group, it's a requirement that you have to sign in on the website, and manually kick or ban every single member one at a time.\n\nEveryone who is removed from a group all get notifications that they were removed from the group without context. For the group owner, this process becomes worse if there is an exorbitant amount of members.\n\nI do not think this step is necessary. Please make it so the group owner does not have to complete this manual process; to have it be done automatically upon deleting the group. Also with the option of pinging everyone with a notification stating that \"this group has been deleted\".",
